License: MIT
Comment: Truncated VSOP87D Earth series from IMCCE
 (ftp://ftp.imcce.fr/pub/ephem/planets/vsop87/), published scientific results
 (A&A 202, 309, 1988) distributed publicly by IMCCE and the CDS without an
 explicit licence text; the converted table is distributed with this project
 under the MIT license, crediting the authors.

Files: src/core/astro/moon_tables_data.cpp
Copyright: 2013-2018 Sonia Keys
License: MIT
Comment: Meeus, Astronomical Algorithms, tables 47.A/47.B, transcribed from
 https://github.com/soniakeys/meeus (v3/moonposition).

Files: assets/sky/bsc5.csv
Copyright: 2026 Juan Maria Gomez Lopez <juan-maria.gomez-lopez@tutamail.com>
           1991 D. Hoffleit and W. H. Warren Jr. (Yale Bright Star Catalogue, NASA ADC)
License: MIT
Comment: Yale Bright Star Catalogue, 5th Revised Ed., CDS catalogue V/50,
 distributed publicly by the NASA Astronomical Data Center and the CDS without
 an explicit licence text; the converted extract is distributed with this
 project under the MIT license, crediting the authors. Installed as
 /opt/drone_simulator/share/sky/bsc5.csv.

Files: src/core/geo/wmm_data.cpp
Copyright: 2026 Juan Maria Gomez Lopez <juan-maria.gomez-lopez@tutamail.com>
License: MIT
Comment: Contains the Gauss coefficients of the World Magnetic Model WMM2025
 (NOAA National Centers for Environmental Information and British Geological
 Survey, https://www.ncei.noaa.gov/products/world-magnetic-model). U.S.
 Government material, public domain and not subject to copyright protection in
 the United States (17 U.S.C. 105, 403). The surrounding code is MIT.

Files: assets/sky/moon_albedo.pgm
Copyright: NASA's Scientific Visualization Studio, CGI Moon Kit (LRO / LROC WAC)
License: public-domain
 Derived from https://svs.gsfc.nasa.gov/4720 (lroc_color_poles_1k.jpg). Work of
 the U.S. Government, not subject to copyright in the United States (17 U.S.C.
 105); used under the NASA media usage guidelines. Credit: NASA's Scientific
 Visualization Studio / LRO / LROC (Arizona State University). Installed as
 /opt/drone_simulator/share/sky/moon_albedo.pgm.
Comment: The binary also contains code instantiated from the GLM headers
 (OpenGL Mathematics 0.9.9.8, Copyright 2005 G-Truc Creation, Debian package
 libglm-dev) and from the nlohmann/json headers (JSON for Modern C++ 3.11,
 Copyright 2013-2022 Niels Lohmann, Debian package nlohmann-json3-dev), both
 used under the MIT license printed below. SDL 3 (zlib license) is used as a
 shared library from the Debian package libsdl3-0, libcurl (curl license)
 as a shared library from the Debian package libcurl4t64, and Assimp (BSD
 3-Clause license) as a shared library from the Debian package libassimp5.

